only take you so far.  Even with his sword in your hand and his armor on your back, will your mettle be enough?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/492870/extras/d2852d1fd53aa366729d371b3d176802.avif?t=1536868390\" width=600 height=90 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your enemy never sleeps</strong></h2>Unravel the mysterious plans of your enemies.  Their commanders work tirelessly to raise and train an army for one purpose – war!  Your life is one thing, but the lives of your children and children’s children is another.  Foil their fiendish plot for future war and destruction.",
